  {"op": "index", "title": "Phase 4b judgment set (crossings)", "intro": "Produced by tools/render_jobs/jobs/phase4b_judgment_set.json at 1920x1080. For every palette biome, a new 150 ft map (seed 1234) with a waist-deep river and a deep pond, a path in the biome's first path surface drawn across the river, then through the real Bridge tool (input events): a plank bridge where the path meets the river, stepping stones downstream and a long plank bridge across the pond (over 5.5 m, so pile bents). Captured in authoring at home, zoom 8 on the bridge (grid off and on), zoom 5 on the stones and zoom 10 on the long bridge; then saved as a _p4b3_ test level and played with tokens on the decks and the stones and one wading beside the bridge, grid on. Last, the phase 4 wetland rebuilt and re-rendered (reeds in the shallows after the rock-foam change). Test levels are deleted at the end."}
